  <description>
    <p>Orange is a music player and collection organizer built with Flutter and a Rust audio and collection core. Made by Gosh; based on the Strawberry and Clementine projects.</p>
    <p>This is an alpha migration. Verified capabilities and platform limitations are documented in PLATFORM_SUPPORT.md.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Browse and search a local music collection</li>
      <li>Manage a play queue and saved playlists</li>
      <li>Import M3U, PLS and XSPF playlists; export M3U</li>
      <li>Internet radio and saved custom stations</li>
      <li>Light, dark and system appearance</li>
      <li>Audio tag editing, equalizer and conversion</li>
      <li>Copy tracks to a selected folder or mounted device</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
